""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぶーん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/09/21/6412256/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"月見団子に続き、\nあーちゃんクッキングーのお話を少し..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お母さんが夕飯を作り始めると\n私もキッチンへ..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/09/21/6412256/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お家にいる時は必ずお手伝いします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本日のメニューは『餃子ちゃん』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/09/21/6412256/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ニラが出ちゃってる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/09/21/6412256/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お母さんが『ワンタン⁉』って\n意地悪言うけど気にしません"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/09/21/6412256/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小さい頃からお手伝いしているのに\nなかなかお料理が上手になりません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんで！？！？\n不思議で不思議で不思議です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お料理上手な女の子になろう！\n女子力アップ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そう決心した、鈴木絢音です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/09/21/6412256/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぶーん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/09/21/6412256/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問に答えるよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/09/21/6412256/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/09/21/6412256/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"秋田県のここは他の県に負けないってところはどこ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"①自然"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/09/21/6412256/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マイナスイオンい－っぱいの\n癒しスポットが沢山あります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"近所でカモシカさんに遭遇！\n目が合っちゃった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/09/21/6412256/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんて事もあります（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"②人と人とのつながり...\n私はね、隣のおばあちゃんと仲良し"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/09/21/6412256/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"右隣のおばあちゃんは山菜採り・お裁縫の達人(｢･ω･)｢"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私のお洋服のお直しをしてくれます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"左隣のおばあちゃんはお料理の達人(｢･ω･)｢"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美味しいコロッケを作ってくれます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どちらのおばあちゃんも私の乃木坂46での活躍を楽しみにしてくれています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほっこり..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/09/21/6412256/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/09/21/6412256/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"秋田の美味しい食べ物は？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/09/21/6412256/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"秋田のオススメの特産物は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お米...じゅんさい...等 沢山ありますが\n今回はきりたんぽ鍋、だまこ鍋をご紹介したいと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きりたんぽは、つぶしたご飯を棒に巻き付け、きつね色に焼いたもの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのきりたんぽを鶏ガラのだし汁に入れて煮込んだものが『きりたんぽ鍋』です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"つぶしたご飯をお団子のように丸くしてだし汁に入れて煮込んだものが『だまこ鍋』です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は、だまこ鍋派です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新米で作る、きりたんぽ・だまこは最高です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/09/21/6412256/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぶーん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/09/21/6412256/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"秋田空港で秋田弁の単語帳発見！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"購入しました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/09/21/6412256/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近きいちゃんが私の秋田弁を真似するの－！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"困ったきいちゃん（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も\n嬉しい 楽しい 幸せな１日でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/09/21/6412256/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/09/21/6412256/0014.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"更新遅れてしまって、ごめんなさい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(最後に...アメブロさんにも参加させていただいてます。是非ご覧下さい！)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まめでな！\nあーちゃん。"}],"source":"archive"}}